      "settings": {
        "no_margins": false,
        "custom_liquid": "<div style='max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;'><p style='text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.12em;font-size:13px;color:#2f519b;margin:0 0 8px;'>The difference</p><h2 style='font-size:34px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 28px;color:#111;'>Electra vs a standard healthcare fabric</h2><table style='width:100%;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;border-collapse:collapse;text-align:left;'><thead><tr><th style='padding:14px 12px;border-bottom:2px solid #2f519b;'></th><th style='padding:14px 12px;border-bottom:2px solid #e0e0dc;text-align:center;font-weight:500;color:#666;'>Standard healthcare fabric</th><th style='padding:14px 12px;border-bottom:2px solid #2f519b;text-align:center;color:#2f519b;'>Electra</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #ececec;'>Antimicrobial &amp; antifungal</td><td style='padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #ececec;text-align:center;'>✓</td><td style='padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #ececec;text-align:center;color:#2f519b;font-weight:700;'>✓</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #ececec;'>Fluid-proof · alcohol &amp; bleach cleanable</td><td style='padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #ececec;text-align:center;'>✓</td><td style='padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #ececec;text-align:center;color:#2f519b;font-weight:700;'>✓</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #ececec;'>Biocompatible (ISO 10993)</td><td style='padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #ececec;text-align:center;'>✓</td><td style='padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #ececec;text-align:center;color:#2f519b;font-weight:700;'>✓</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #ececec;'><strong>Permanently antistatic / ESD-protective</strong></td><td style='padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #ececec;text-align:center;color:#bbb;'>—</td><td style='padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #ececec;text-align:center;color:#2f519b;font-weight:700;'>✓</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:12px;'><strong>Refined colour palette (not black-only)</strong></td><td style='padding:12px;text-align:center;color:#bbb;'>limited</td><td style='padding:12px;text-align:center;color:#2f519b;font-weight:700;'>9 shades</td></tr></tbody></table><p style='margin-top:22px;'><em>Everything a healthcare fabric should be — plus the ESD protection static-sensitive rooms require.</em></p></div>"
