      "name": "Built for clinical use",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Beyond antistatic",
        "title": "Built for clinical use",
        "body": "<p>Alongside its ESD protection, Electra brings everything a clinical surface needs. Its <strong>bi-directional elasticity</strong> follows the body and the furniture for comfortable, complex shapes, while a <strong>heat-weldable</strong> thermoplastic coating gives clean, durable seams with fewer points of failure. The antimicrobial, easy-clean surface resists staining from bodily fluids, and Electra is <strong>biocompatible</strong> — non-irritating and non-cytotoxic to ISO 10993-5 and ISO 10993-10.</p>",
        "body_position": "above",
        "columns": 4,
        "bg_color": "#ffffff",
